  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 382 + 9 ÷ 4 - 39 × 172 = 74\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 9 and 4 \n\n382 + 9 ÷ 4 - 39 × 172 = 74 ⇒ 382 + 4 ÷ 9 - 39 × 172 = 74\n\n⇒ 382 + __**4 ÷ 9**__ - 39 × 172 = 74\n\n⇒ __**382 + 0.44**__ - 6708 = 74\n\n⇒ __382.44** - 6708**__ = 74\n\n⇒ -6325.56 ≠ 74 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 4 and 172\n\n382 + 9 ÷ 4 - 39 × 172 = 74 ⇒ 382 + 9 ÷ 172 - 39 × 4 = 74\n\n⇒ 382 + __**9 ÷ 172**__ - 39 × 4 = 74\n\n⇒ 382 + 0.05 - __**39 × 4**__ = 74\n\n⇒ __**382 + 0.05**__ - 156 = 74\n\n⇒ __382.05** - 156**__ = 74\n\n⇒ 226.05 ≠ 74 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 382 and 39\n\n382 + 9 ÷ 4 - 39 × 172 = 74 ⇒ 39 + 9 ÷ 4 - 382 × 172 = 74\n\n⇒ 39 + __**9 ÷ 4**__ - 382 × 172 = 74\n\n⇒ 39 + 2.25 - __**382 × 172**__ = 74\n\n⇒ __**39 + 2.25**__ - 65704 = 74\n\n⇒ __**41.25 - 65704**__ = 74\n\n⇒ -65662.75 ≠ 74 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 9 and 172\n\n382 + 9 ÷ 4 - 39 × 172 = 74 ⇒ 382 + 172 ÷ 4 - 39 × 9 = 74\n\n⇒ 382 + __**172 ÷ 4**__ - 39 × 9 = 74\n\n⇒ 382 + 43 - __**39 × 9**__ = 74\n\n⇒ __**382 + 43**__ - 351 = 74\n\n⇒ __425** - 351**__ = 74\n\n**⇒ 74 = 74 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
